{"speciesId":477,"names":{"fr":"Noctunoir","es":"Dusknoir","en":"Dusknoir","ja":"ヨノワール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This feared Pokémon is said to travel to worlds unknown. Some even believe that it takes lost spirits along with it."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"This feared Pokémon is said to travel to worlds unknown. Some even believe that it takes lost spirits along with it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps se replie sur lui-même pour emprisonner les esprits perdus et les ramener chez eux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps se replie sur lui-même pour emprisonner les esprits perdus et les ramener chez eux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps se replie sur lui-même pour emprisonner les esprits perdus et les ramener chez eux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se dice que recoge en su cuerpo flexible a los espíritus extraviados y los guía hasta casa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"弾力のある 体の 中に 行き場のない 魂を 取りこんで あの世に 連れていくと 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"L’antenne sur sa tête capte les ondes radio du monde des esprits lui ordonnant d’y porter des gens."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La antena de la cabeza capta ondas de otra dimensión que le incitan a llevarse allí a la gente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"頭の アンテナで 霊界からの 電波を 受信。指示を 受けて 人を 霊界へ 連れて行くのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son corps se replie sur lui-même pour emprisonner les esprits perdus et les ramener chez eux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se dice que recoge en su cuerpo flexible a los espíritus extraviados y los guía hasta casa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"弾力のある 体の 中に 行き場のない 魂を 取りこんで あの世に 連れていくと 言われる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"L’antenne sur sa tête capte les ondes radio du monde des esprits lui ordonnant d’y porter des gens."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La antena de la cabeza capta ondas de otra dimensión que le incitan a llevarse allí a la gente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の アンテナで 霊界からの 電波を 受信。指示を 受けて 人を 霊界へ 連れて行くのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Nul ne sait s’il est doté d’une volonté propre. Les ondes du monde des esprits le poussent à conduire humains et Pokémon vers l’au-delà."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se desconoce si posee voluntad propia. Capta ondas de otra dimensión que le incitan a llevarse allí a humanos y Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"意思が あるのか わかっていない。 霊界からの 電波に 従い 人や ポケモンを 連れ去るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il dévore l’âme de ses ennemis en les engloutissant dans sa bouche ventrale. Il recrache ensuite leur enveloppe corporelle."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Engulle a los rivales con la boca del estómago y, tras haber devorado el alma, escupe el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"With the mouth on its belly, Dusknoir swallows its target whole. The soul is the only thing eaten— Dusknoir disgorges the body before departing."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"狙った 相手を 腹の口で 丸飲み。 魂だけを 食い 肉体は 吐き出し 去っていく。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife. Known to mistakenly take the souls of those who yet have life left in them, albeit rarely."}],"varieties":[{"id":477,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"t